The platform layer is resonsible for:
- Window Management
- Closing the application
- Setting input state
- Drawing graphics on screen


API:

// sets app to initial state
// should be called once before game loop
initialize()

// sets the inputs that are used by the snake game
// should be called once per frame
set_inputs()

// updates the game simulation one tick
// should be called once per frame
// returns:
// - a list of draw commands that the platform will need to decide on how to draw
// - whether or not the game is now requesting to close or not
update() -> draw_commands, still_running

